1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,560
你想要的一切，都在等着你
Everything you want is waiting for you.

2
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:10,000
你会憧憬未来，是因为那个未来真实存在，它在等着你
You daydream about your future because that future exists, waiting for you.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,480
这就是宇宙的法则。你要相信它，为你想要的未来去争取
This is the law of the universe. Trust it and fight for the future you want.

4
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:19,600
听起来很玄、很鸡汤、很老套，但说实话——
It sounds witchy, woo and cliché, but honestly—

5
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:25,120
如果你告诉我，我会有几十万粉丝
If you told me I'd have hundreds of thousands of subscribers,

6
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:29,440
说我二十多岁的今年会去纽约，还有人认出我："你是 Luma 吗？"
and this year, in my 20s, I went to New York and people recognized me: "Are you Luma?"

7
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:34,160
那太不可思议了。我还在世界另一端，见到了我的粉丝
It was incredible. I even met some of my subscribers on the other side of the world.

8
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:38,720
所以相信我，听我说——因为我就是活生生的证明
So trust me, take it from me — I'm living proof of this.

9
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:42,600
你想要的东西就在那里，属于你的终究是你的。相信这一点
The things you want are out there, and what's meant for you is yours. Believe that,

10
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:45,600
相信你可以显化任何你想要的东西
and trust that you can manifest anything you want.
